Dear {{{Case.Student_Name__c}}}

Thank you for reaching out. Your mail with the subject line "{{{Case.Subject}}}".is assigned with the ticket ID {{{Case.CaseNumber}}}. Please wait for our Helpdesk counsellor to address it and send the reply. For all future correspondence regarding this do not change the Ticket ID and the subject line. 

For any communication, please write only to the helpdesk at helpdesk@dsuonline.com. You can also call @ +919880148004 (Timings: 8:45 am to 4:45 pm, Monday to Saturday).

{{{Case.Thread_Token}}} 

Centre for Distance and Online Education (CDOE)

